mapping "V5712.1" source="V5712" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5712 (Swedish extension of ICD-10 V57.1) = passenger of light truck injured in
        nontraffic collision with fixed/stationary object, while engaged in forvärvsarbete (work).
        SNOMED CT has no concept encoding the work-activity dimension; the parent V57.1 crosswalk is
        followed. 437738 (captures the non-traffic aspect, the most specific axis). 436292 (captures the
        collision-with-fixed-object axis). 444074 (general vehicular-accident victim concept). All three
        are legitimate ancestors that fully contain the source; the dropped activity axis is a one-level
        breadth mismatch. for the two specific targets (verified crosswalk on parent, small breadth
        mismatch); for the general victim concept.
        """
}
